# EE-220: Verilog HDL Architecture & Pipeline Verification
**Instructor:** Prof. Sarah Chen

```verilog
module alu_32bit (
    input  wire [31:0] a,
    input  wire [31:0] b,
    input  wire [2:0]  opcode,
    output reg  [31:0] result,
    output wire        zero_flag
);
    always @(*) begin
        case (opcode)
            3'b000: result = a + b;
            3'b001: result = a - b;
            3'b010: result = a & b;
            3'b011: result = a | b;
            3'b100: result = a ^ b;
            default: result = 32'h00000000;
        endcase
    end
    assign zero_flag = (result == 32'h0);
endmodule
```
